<button type="button" aria-current="page" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-900">Today</button>
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold bg-white border border-slate-300 text-slate-700">All tools</button>
</nav>
<header class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3">
<div>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-700">Student workspace</p>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Eagle</h2>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 items-end">
<button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="bl-today-setup" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-slate-400 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">Student and role settings</button>
</div>
</header>
<section class="rounded-xl border border-indigo-300 bg-indigo-50 p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-3" aria-labelledby="bl-getting-started" data-bl-getting-started="true">
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
<h3 id="bl-getting-started" class="text-lg font-bold text-indigo-950">Start with one observation</h3>
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 px-2 text-sm text-indigo-900 underline">Skip guide</button>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-indigo-950" role="status">1. Student selected · 2. Add data · 3. Preview your review</p>
<p class="text-sm text-indigo-950">A context note captures what happened before, what you observed, and what happened after. No target setup or AI is required.</p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-indigo-400 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-indigo-900">Record an observation</button>
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-indigo-400 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-indigo-900">Import existing data</button>
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-indigo-400 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-indigo-900">Explore an example</button>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-indigo-950">For systematic measurement, define a target below: count how often, time how long, time from a cue, or sample intervals. Example data opens in a separate practice workspace.</p>
</section>
<section class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-4 sm:p-5" aria-labelledby="bl-today-record">
<h3 id="bl-today-record" class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Record what happened today</h3>
<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Capture what you saw and heard. You can review patterns and possible explanations later.</p>
<div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg bg-indigo-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-indigo-800">Add observation</button>
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-slate-400 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">Start or resume timed observation</button>
</div>
<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-700">Timed recording also lets you resume a saved recording draft.</p>
</section>
<section class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-4 sm:p-5" aria-labelledby="bl-today-targets">
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start justify-between gap-3">
<div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
<h3 id="bl-today-targets" class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">What are you observing?</h3>
<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-700 break-words">Define a target once, then use it in observations and review.</p>
</div>
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-slate-400 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">Define a target</button>
</div>
</section>
<section class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-4 sm:p-5" aria-labelledby="bl-today-review">
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
<h3 id="bl-today-review" class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">Review and follow through</h3>
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-slate-400 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">Review observations</button>
</div>
<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Your observations will appear here. A context note is a useful place to start.</p>
<div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-slate-400 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">Work on a support plan</button>
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-slate-400 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">Prepare a progress review</button>
</div>
</section>
<details class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-4">
<summary class="min-h-11 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Workspace files and settings</summary>
<p role="status" class="text-sm text-slate-700 my-2">Changes save automatically in this browser. Download a backup to keep a file copy.</p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-slate-400 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">Download backup</button>
<button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-slate-400 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">Load workspace from file</button>
</div>
<input type="file" accept=".json" aria-label="Load BehaviorLens workspace JSON file" class="hidden"/>
</details>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-700">Find specialist tools, learning resources, and practice scenarios in All tools.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>"
`;
